---
title: Barbecue Sauce
source: Mom
servings: 8
prep time: 0 minutes
cook time: 20 minutes
---

Combine @ketchup{1-1/2%cups}, @apple cider vinegar{1%cup}, @worcestershire sauce{1/4%cup}, @soy sauce{1/4%cup}, @brown sugar{1%cup}(packed), @dry mustard{2%tbsp}, @chili powder{4%tbsp}, @garlic{2%cloves}(minced), @vegetable oil{3%tbsp}, and @honey{}(to taste) in a #medium saucepan{}.

Bring to a simmer and, stirring often, let simmer for ~{5%minutes}.

Use immediately, or keep covered and refrigerated for up to 2 weeks.
